sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant Frontend as Frontend Admin
    participant Auth as auth-service
    participant AdminService as admin-service
    participant LangGraph as Orchestration LangGraph
    participant Retrieval as retrieval-service
    participant Generation as generation-service

    Admin->>Frontend: Envoyer une demande admin
    Frontend->>Auth: Verifier l'authentification admin
    Auth-->>Frontend: Token valide
    Frontend->>AdminService: Transmettre la demande
    AdminService->>LangGraph: Initialiser le traitement
    LangGraph->>LangGraph: Classifier l'intention

    alt Demande d'information / conseil
        LangGraph->>Retrieval: Recuperer le contexte pertinent
        Retrieval-->>LangGraph: Sources et passages
        LangGraph->>Generation: Produire la reponse
        Generation-->>LangGraph: Reponse contextuelle
    else Demande operationnelle simple
        LangGraph->>LangGraph: Appliquer une branche directe
    end

    LangGraph-->>AdminService: Synthese finale
    AdminService-->>Frontend: Reponse admin structuree
    Frontend-->>Admin: Afficher la reponse dans le chat
